<span id="S2.T2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:125.2pt;">
<span id="S2.T2.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.T2.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Was Barack Obama born in the United States? (</span><span id="S2.T2.2.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;"> Yes</span><span id="S2.T2.2.2.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">)</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S2.T2.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"></td>
<td id="S2.T2.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt"></td>
<td id="S2.T2.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_tt">
<span id="S2.T2.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:256.1pt;">
<span id="S2.T2.2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S2.T2.2.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">The question explicitly states the required information for the answer – the birth place of Barack Obama. The answer is likely to be found in a single text fragment in Wikipedia.</span></span>
